      "title": "06_Contoso_Properties_Management_Pack_Q1_2026.pdf - Section 1 (Part 1)",
      "content": "<!-- Page 1 -->\n\nContoso Properties LLC\nManagement Pack – Statement of Profit or Loss for the quarter ended 31 March 2026\nStatus: Final management pack (unaudited) Prepared: 14 April 2026 Currency: AED\nAED Q1 2026\nRevenue 5,240,000\nDirect property costs (1,048,000)\nGross profit 4,192,000\nOperating expenses (3,215,400)\nOperating profit 976,600\nFinance costs (273,000)\nProfit before tax 703,600\nCorporate tax (9%) (63,324)\nNet profit for the period 640,276\nCash position\nClosing cash at 31 March 2026 was AED 1,180,000, against a minimum operating cash requirement of AED\n1,500,000, a shortfall of AED 320,000.\nCFO commentary\nThe cash shortfall at the end of the quarter is mainly timing. Rent collections from two commercial tenants, totalling\nAED 410,000, were received in the first week of April rather than in March. We also paid AED 260,000 of planned\nmaintenance on the Marina tower earlier than budgeted. We do not expect a shortfall at the end of the second",
